msgid "The main order you picked is not a paid one, so your revenue figures will drop by the amount of the paid orders being cancelled. Picking a paid order as the main order avoids this."
msgstr "El pedido principal que elegiste no está pagado, así que tus cifras de ingresos bajarán en el importe de los pedidos pagados que se cancelan. Elegir un pedido pagado como principal lo evita."

