#: includes/brikpanel-net-watch.php:148
msgid ""
"A wait this long usually means the connection between this computer and your "
"site is stuck, or the server is overloaded."
msgstr ""
"Una espera tan larga suele significar que la conexión entre este ordenador y "
"tu sitio está atascada o que el servidor está sobrecargado."

#. translators: %s: time the server needed for this page, for example "0.6 s".
